# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) to skip the login page in local dev.
# AuthBoot submits these to the real /login/ endpoint at boot; every gate
# (consent, onboarding, password reset) still applies. Dev builds only —
# `vite build` strips the whole code path.
#
# Any seed user works; see `make seed` output for the full list.
